Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/addtiffo/tif_overview.c
Line: 871
Function: TIFFBuildOverviews
Bug type: divide-by-zero
CWE: CWE-369
Explanation: nOXSize is computed as (nXSize + panOvList[i] - 1) / panOvList[i] without validating panOvList[i]. If an overview factor of 0 is provided in panOvList, this results in a divide-by-zero.

Source context:
